DESCRIPTION: le_mol - SPLIT SPLIT album release show  everything splits. le_mol loop. what remains? SPLIT SPLIT - their 6th post-rock record (Noise Appeal Records).  While some splits are inevitable (Splitsville)\, forced (Splitter) or even pathological (Split Brain) many a split in society feels avoidable yet driven by certain forces in the discourse (Split The Rich). If splits were to be split again and again however\, wouldnt that mean a comeback of nuance\, plurality and community? SPLIT SPLIT.  Musically\, SPLIT SPLIT offers a mix of melancholic post-rock and shoegaze with elements of post-punk\, ambient and industrial.  The use of multiple loop stations allows the two multi-instrumentalists to portray a 5-piece band and leads to surprising twists and turns challenging listening habits.  Loops stick together - they never split!   Our Ceasing Voice  Die Innsbrucker Post-Rock-Pioniere Our Ceasing Voice sind zurück. Mit neuen Songs und ihrem unverwechselbaren Sound zwischen atmosphärischen Klanglandschaften und düsterer Wucht. Krachendes Schlagzeug\, massive Gitarrenwände und tiefe\, raue Vocals: So klingt es\, wenn Mark Lanegan auf Caspian\, Thrice und Cult of Luna trifft.
